 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 5.662,
   "text": "Once again a large crowd gathered. For three days, they had nothing to eat.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 5.962,
   "end": 11.745,
   "text": "I have compassion for these people. If I send them home hungry, they will faint on the way.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 12.245,
   "end": 18.093,
   "text": "They had only seven loaves. Jesus gave thanks, broke them, and four thousand people ate.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 18.493,
   "end": 21.672,
   "text": "And they picked up seven basketfuls of leftovers.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 22.272,
   "end": 27.32,
   "text": "At Bethsaida, some people brought a blind man, and begged Jesus to touch him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 27.62,
   "end": 33.136,
   "text": "Jesus led him out of the village, put spit on his eyes, and laid his hands on him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 33.536,
   "end": 34.912,
   "text": "Do you see anything?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 35.312,
   "end": 38.158,
   "text": "I see people. They look like trees, walking around.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 38.758,
   "end": 45.673,
   "text": "Once more, Jesus put his hands on his eyes. Then his sight was restored, and he saw everything clearly.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 46.473,
   "end": 51.12,
   "text": "On the road, Jesus asked his disciples: Who do people say I am?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 51.52,
   "end": 55.906,
   "text": "Some say John the Baptist. Others say Elijah. Others, one of the prophets.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 56.306,
   "end": 58.957,
   "text": "But what about you? Who do you say I am?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 59.657,
   "end": 60.773,
   "text": "You are the Messiah.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 61.673,
   "end": 67.894,
   "text": "Then he began to teach them that he must suffer, be killed, and after three days, rise again.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 68.294,
   "end": 71.668,
   "text": "Peter took him aside, and began to rebuke him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 71.968,
   "end": 76.235,
   "text": "Get behind me, Satan! You are not thinking of the things of God.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 76.835,
   "end": 82.405,
   "text": "Whoever wants to follow me must deny themselves, take up their cross, and follow me.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 82.905,
   "end": 87.097,
   "text": "What good is it to gain the whole world, yet lose your soul?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 87.996,
   "end": 91.436,
   "text": "Follow for part thirteen.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}